⍝ IfElse.tc

      ⍝   ]log 9  ON   ⍝ fix logging
⍝@ test3.

      ⍝   ]log 48 ON   ⍝ IfElse logging

      ⍝ test various COND →→ THEN ←→ ELSE ←← cases

      ⍝ test COND variants (primarily error conditions)
      ⍝
      2 →→ 'True' ←→ 'False' ←←
DOMAIN ERROR+
      2
      ^
      )MORE
array is not Boolean (expecting 0 or 1).
      )SIC
      )CHECK BRIEF


      1+1 →→ 'True' ←→ 'False' ←←
DOMAIN ERROR+
      1+1
      ^
      )MORE
array is not Boolean (expecting 0 or 1).

      )SIC
      )CHECK BRIEF


      1 1 →→ 'True' ←→ 'False' ←←
LENGTH ERROR+
      1 1
      ^
      )MORE
Boolean array has length 2 (expecting length 1).
      )SIC
      )CHECK BRIEF


      ''  →→ 'True' ←→ 'False' ←←
LENGTH ERROR+
      ''
      ^
      )MORE
Boolean array is empty (expecting length 1).
      )SIC
      )CHECK BRIEF


      ⍝ test COND TRUE variants
      ⍝
      1 →→ 'True' ←→ 'False' ←←
True
      1 →→ 1+1 ←→ 'False' ←←
2
      1 →→ ←→ 'False' ←←   ⍝ empty THEN
SYNTAX ERROR+
      )MORE
empty →→ ... ←→ (aka. empty THEN)
      )SIC
      )CHECK BRIEF


      1 →→ 'True' ←→  ←←   ⍝ empty ELSE
SYNTAX ERROR+
      )MORE
empty ←→ ... ←← (aka. empty ELSE)
      )SIC
      )CHECK BRIEF

      1 →→ ←→ ←←           ⍝ empty THEN and ELSE
SYNTAX ERROR+
      )MORE
empty →→ ... ←→ (aka. empty THEN)
      )SIC
      )CHECK BRIEF


