      ⍝ functions
      ⍝
      )ERASE FOO

∇FOO COND
[1] 'Line 1 (if-else-endif)'
[2] COND    →→
[3] 'TRUE'  ←→
[4] 'FALSE' ←←
[5]  'Line 5' COND
∇

      )SIC
      )CHECK BRIEF

      FOO 0
Line 1 (if-else-endif)
FALSE
 Line 5 0 

      FOO 1
Line 1 (if-else-endif)
TRUE
 Line 5 1 

      )MORE
NO )MORE ERROR INFO

      )SIC
      )CHECK BRIEF

      )ERASE FOO

∇FOO COND
[1]  'Line 1 (if-endif)'
[2]  COND   →→
[3]  'TRUE' ←←
[4]  'Line 4' COND
∇

      )CHECK BRIEF

      FOO 0
Line 1 (if-endif)
 Line 4 0 

      FOO 1
Line 1 (if-endif)
TRUE
 Line 4 1 

      )ERASE FOO

∇FOO COND
[1] 'Line 1 (single line if-else-endif)'
[2] COND →→ 'TRUE' ←→ 'FALSE' ←←
[3]  'Line 3' COND
∇

      FOO 0
Line 1 (single line if-else-endif)
FALSE
 Line 3 0 

      FOO 1
Line 1 (single line if-else-endif)
TRUE
 Line 3 1 

      )MORE
NO )MORE ERROR INFO

