      ⍝ all subsets of size K in ⍳N
      ⍝
∇Z←K KinN N;Z1;Z2
 K∈1,N →→ Z←{,⍵}¨⍳N                 ◊ →OUT ←→
 K>N÷2 →→ Z←{(⍳N) ∼ ⍵}¨(N-K) KinN N ◊ →OUT ←→
 Z1←,K KinN N-1                            ←← ←←
 Z2←⊃N {⊂(⊃⍵),⍺}¨ ((K-1) KinN N-1)        ⍝ items with N
 Z←Z1 ∪ Z2
OUT:
 Z←Z[⍋Z]
∇

      ⍪(⍳N) {8 ⎕CR ⍺ KinN ⍵}¨N←4
